"text": "位的一次监测值仍有不同程度的超标现象：如1985年7月，临洪河口海区铜监测值超标", "score": 0.9268454982013237}, {"text": "率13.3%；10月，港区化学耗氧量超标率8.3%，石油类超标率20%。1986年以后，海域", "score": 0.9308247439404751}, {"text": "污染呈上升趋势。", "score": 0.8554424312379625}, {"text": "1986~1990年连云港市各海区主要污染物监测数据统计表", "score": 0.8820940176645915}, {"text": "表 6- 8", "score": 0.7547522442681449}, {"text": "单位：毫克/升", "score": 0.8157776296138763}, {"text": "石油类", "score": 0.7472681254148483}, {"text": "无机磷", "score": 0.7491885125637054}, {"text": "化学耗氧量", "score": 0.7719117701053619}, {"text": "无机氮", "score": 0.7180172801017761}, {"text": "海区", "score": 0.557934045791626}, {"text": "年份", "score": 0.6663443048795065}, {"text": "超标", "score": 0.605344831943512}, {"text": "超标", "score": 0.6326286395390829}, {"text": "超标", "score": 0.6656475265820821}, {"text": "超标", "score": 0.6663510402043661}, {"text": "超标", "score": 0.5721161166826884}, {"text": "均值", "score": 0.6664860049883524}, {"text": "均值", "score": 0.5161579251289368}, {"text": "均值", "score": 0.6657872597376505}, {"text": "均值", "score": 0.6524897217750549}, {"text": "均值", "score": 0.6631424029668173}, {"text": "倍数", "score": 0.6648202935854594}, {"text": "倍数", "score": 0.6649150053660074}, {"text": "倍数", "score": 0.6448651552200317}, {"text": "倍数", "score": 0.652914027372996}, {"text": "倍数", "score": 0.6245804826418558}, {"text": "临洪", "score": 0.6642157236735026}, {"text": "1986", "score": 0.7761213302612304}, {"text": "3.20", "score": 0.7060357213020325}, {"text": "0.17", "score": 0.7566401600837708}, {"text": "0.09", "score": 0.7579094886779785}, {"text": "0.037", "score": 0.7712315320968628}, {"text": "0.009", "score": 0.8138264119625092}, {"text": "1987", "score": 0.7951518177986145}, {"text": "0.21", "score": 0.7072185277938843}, {"text": "11.20", "score": 0.8326933979988098}, {"text": "0.024", "score": 0.8208354810873667}, {"text": "1.24", "score": 0.7750920653343201}, {"text": "0.10", "score": 0.7992629647254944}, {"text": "0.003", "score": 0.7627009848753611}